# ADR 0092: the flight scenes at the terrain share. 6 workers = 0.6 x B (B = 10 on this machine) per ADR 0092's worked example, not a rule.
# Flights judged: dive, dive-fast, look-1m, look-2km; teleport-1m and teleport-2km recorded, not judged.
# One configuration: no stop rule applies (it needs a reference and another configuration); every round runs.
rounds 3
retries 1
config share6
flight dive stream dive --store C:/DEV/SeriousPlanetData/global16384 --gen-workers 6
flight dive-fast stream dive-fast --store C:/DEV/SeriousPlanetData/global16384 --gen-workers 6
flight look-1m stream look-1m --store C:/DEV/SeriousPlanetData/global16384 --gen-workers 6
flight look-2km stream look-2km --store C:/DEV/SeriousPlanetData/global16384 --gen-workers 6
flight teleport-1m stream teleport-1m --store C:/DEV/SeriousPlanetData/global16384 --gen-workers 6
flight teleport-2km stream teleport-2km --store C:/DEV/SeriousPlanetData/global16384 --gen-workers 6
